SY_TALK("xWcULCfQ5XE",[[759,["For the last so many lectures, we have been saying"]],[767,["that you cannot pay for God’s love."]],[770,["It makes me laugh sometimes."]],[776,["Human beings can never understand his love,"]],[781,["because they live in a very limited sphere."]],[785,["His love is unlimited. His forgiveness is unlimited."]],[789,["Even this word “unlimited” and “infinite”, we do not understand"]],[797,["because we have not known anything like that."]],[800,["And to say that something is genuine"]],[803,["is also like certifying something that is genuine."]],[806,["You don’t need a certificate."]],[808,["Even that human beings don't understand."]],[812,["We live with artificiality,"]],[818,["we try to find the truth,"]],[821,["again we accept artificiality as truth."]],[825,["Again we go on fighting."]],[827,["Then we think this is the truth."]],[830,["Again that turns out to be something, artificial thing"]],[833,["or some sort of a mental projection."]],[836,["All these limited endeavours of human beings"]],[844,["and the experiences they have,"]],[847,["made him so conditioned,"]],[852,["that it is not easy to understand God."]],[858,["He made all this universe in his compassion and love."]],[864,["He created you as human beings, also in his compassion and love."]],[868,["He doesn’t need anything."]],[870,["But he loves."]],[873,["And you can’t understand a person who loves beyond any reason,"]],[880,["without any reward, just love because for love’s sake."]],[887,["We can’t think of one human being like that, who can love only for love’s sake."]],[895,["Only after Realization, as you grow more and more,"]],[900,["you realise that loving is the greatest joy."]],[907,["And then, you cannot think of money in relation to him."]],[911,["It's something, you'll say but, I think,"]],[916,["even to say this, \"We don't need money or we don't take money\""]],[920,["itself is so low level."]],[925,["It's so, so much gross."]],[931,["Because money and all these concepts are your own."]],[938,["He didn't make this world to get any fruits out of it."]],[943,["Nothing."]],[945,["He just made it because he loved."]],[948,["He wanted to express His Love."]],[949,["Just to manifest that Love, he made this world."]],[953,["There’s nothing else expected"]],[955,["and to put the human mind at that level is an impossibility, I find, in the beginning."]],[960,["But gradually they start understanding how forgiving he is,"]],[965,["how kind he is, how nice he is."]],[968,["So the first problem I have to face in the West always"]],[972,["even in Paris this was the problem that I faced"]],[976,["was that human beings feel guilty."]],[982,["And this guilt is such a big problem in the West,"]],[985,["I just don't understand."]],[987,["You see, why do you feel guilty so much,"]],[989,["as that is one of the hurdles of Sahaja Yoga, I've seen,"]],[992,["that people start feeling guilty."]],[994,["To such an extent,"]],[996,["that they don't believe that they can get Realization."]],[1000,["They think they are sinners born outright,"]],[1003,["permanently, branded as 'sinners',"]],[1007,["and they can never take their Realization."]],[1010,["I mean, just they brand themselves."]],[1012,["It's beyond self pity also,"]],[1014,["I would say it's even self-destructive."]],[1018,["Today, I've taken up this subject of Left Vishuddhi,"]],[1022,["because I felt that I must one day speak on this subject,"]],[1026,["that this is absolutely,"]],[1030,["not inteligible to God that you are guilty. For what?"]],[1038,["Guilty for what are you?"]],[1041,["If you ask yourself, you'll say, \"Oh, we are guilty,"]],[1044,["because we've crucified Christ\" at the most."]],[1047,["That is the maximum guilt a human being, let's say, on his head."]],[1051,["\"We crucified Christ, we tortured all the saints\". All right."]],[1059,["But by being guilty what do you get?"]],[1063,["Do you get Him back, can you go back and correct that situation?"]],[1067,["You cannot."]],[1070,["But harping upon that, you do get into your subconscious mind."]],[1074,["You get into a position where you are no more normal to receive the Love of God."]],[1082,["You recede into a corner of your mind,"]],[1085,["which is darkness,"]],[1087,["which is ignorant, which is blindness,"]],[1090,["where you cannot receive that beautiful reign,"]],[1094,["that eternal flow that's coming in."]],[1101,["You hide yourself, at the back,"]],[1104,["and then you say,"]],[1106,["\"What about the sun?"]],[1108,["I cannot receive it because I don't deserve it.\""]],[1115,["Behind all this ego orientation in the West -"]],[1118,["Oh, I think, I wish they were purely egoistical. They are not."]],[1123,["All this ego recedes bac ,into that little pouch, what we call the 'guilt'."]],[1131,["You say something to someone."]],[1134,["It's saying that point, that stage,"]],[1137,["that, \"I've said it. All right, I've said it. I can take the responsability, i's good.\""]],[1141,["Not that."]],[1142,["But you come back home, \"Oh, I should not have said that\"."]],[1147,["So you wobble between one kind of action into another kind,"]],[1153,["from say, into an aggressive"]],[1156,["to another one of a receding type"]],[1159,["And this wobbling really,"]],[1162,["is very, very troublesome."]],[1164,["It can go on too much."]],[1166,["The oscilation could be so much."]],[1169,["that it can make you absolutely frantic,"]],[1172,["diffident, and sometimes, useless."]],[1181,["On the contrary,"]],[1183,["God wants to find human beings,"]],[1186,["who are cheerful people,"]],[1187,["who are happy people,"]],[1189,["who are thankful to Him for His blessings."]],[1194,["The most unhappy animal in this world,"]],[1198,["is the human being, can you believe that?"]],[1201,["Animals, don't know happiness and unhappiness, also a good point is."]],[1207,["But the most unhappy human being,"]],[1209,["and the most complicated human being,"]],[1213,["has become so over you see, self-destructive,"]],[1216,["that a destruction force is built within himself."]],[1221,["Now think of that force that has built you up into a human"]],[1227,["how with care and love,"]],[1229,["without your knowledge, without troubling you."]],[1232,["Even when you were born you never knew what was the pain,"]],[1235,["of the birth. Your mother took over it."]],[1238,["He's made you a human being"]],[1241,["so carefully, delicately he's built you up."]],[1247,["For what?"]],[1249,["What is the fruit of this beautiful flower?"]],[1254,["Why the flower starts hitting itself?"]],[1256,["Have you ever heard of anyone like that?"]],[1261,["This is the worst disease, which"]],[1264,["we in the West suffer."]],[1269,["French yes,"]],[1271,["we had at least double the number of people"]],[1273,["that we have here today, surprisingly."]],[1275,["But, also they have the same problem."]],[1278,["And I think all their psychologists,"]],[1283,["psychoanalists,"]],[1285,["or we can say the, all the books,"]],[1289,["all the writers, the philosophers,"]],[1291,["everyone has done to them."]],[1296,["They have given these ideas,"]],[1299,["and everybody accepts them."]],[1302,["And they curse themselves morning till evening,"]],[1306,["walking with so many wrinkles on the forehead."]],[1309,["When you ask them, they will say,"]],[1311,["\"Mother we are very unhappy people\"."]],[1314,["It's like asking unhappiness to come and decorate you."]],[1322,["But it has a subtler meaning of which people are not aware."]],[1331,["These are the times,"]],[1334,["when you have to get your Realization."]],[1337,["This mass Realization has to work out."]],[1340,["It's all prophesized,"]],[1342,["and very important times are these."]],[1345,["All the stars are acting to help us."]],[1349,["The whole universe is helping us."]],[1352,["All the elements are helping us."]],[1355,["We are on the stage."]],[1359,["But when the actors arrive on the stage,"]],[1362,["they are finished, they can't act."]],[1364,["They can't do anything, they can't play their game."]],[1367,["They are so involved with their different roles."]],[1374,["And that is why one has to understand the subtler effect of it,"]],[1377,["then only you will get rid of this guilt."]],[1380,["You are playing into the hands of negative forces."]],[1385,["They are not less than any atomic bombs,"]],[1391,["built within yourselves."]],[1394,["Now what is the way it works out,"]],[1396,["I think people do not realize it."]],[1398,["It's a very subtle method."]],[1400,["Let's see the atomic bomb,"]],[1402,["hidrogen bomb, what will you do there?"]],[1407,["They will separate something which should not be separated."]],[1413,["We break atom, which is not divisible,"]],[1418,["into its divisible parts."]],[1421,["So we put a pressure to break them."]],[1427,["And when that breaking force,"]],[1430,["that aggression I would say,"]],[1432,["is worked out,"]],[1436,["that becomes another destructive force."]],[1441,["So whatever effort we have put into that,"]],[1444,["multiplies, it's not the same force."]],[1449,["And that we use for our destruction."]],[1453,["I mean, this only human being can do,","to create things to destroy himself."]],[1459,["But this force, which works within our minds,"]],[1462,["within ourselves, within our being,"]],[1464,["where we actually really hate ourselves sometimes I feel,"]],[1468,["the way we are destroying ourselves,"]],[1472,["this force"]],[1474,["we build within ourselves thanks to  many"]],[1477,["nonsensical writers and conditioners"]],[1479,["and people who talk of conditioning really condition you much worse!"]],[1484,["You should be singing and chanting like a bird."]],[1487,["You should be laughing and enjoying like a flower."]],[1491,["But I find human beings faces,"]],[1493,["all, looking so very unhappy."]],[1497,["What's the reason?"]],[1500,["The reason is you are separated from your own being,"]],[1506,["the being that integrates you. You are completely disintegrated."]],[1511,["When you disintegrate the hidrogen atom"]],[1518,["you form a very big force built into it."]],[1521,["In the same way, you are the disintegrating your being:"]],[1527,["your physical being on one side, your mental being on another side,"]],[1531,["your spiritual being on another side, there's no integrating point."]],[1537,["And when you cannot feel that integration,"]],[1542,["you feel guilty,"]],[1543,["but that guilt is just a symptom of"]],[1546,["a very big destructive force built in you."]],[1552,["This is the way we are going to destroy ourselves."]],[1559,["No other way."]],[1561,["Our destruction is not going to come to us from outside."]],[1564,["That can be controlled."]],[1567,["It's going to come from within, within ourselves."]],[1573,["Everything we do now, after disintegration,"]],[1577,["is further disintegration","or further building up that negative force within us."]],[1588,["But to integrate it,"]],[1592,["to make you feel complete integration with all your being,"]],[1598,["it's only possible"]],[1601,["if you can somehow or other"]],[1603,["get to that integrating force"]],[1605,["which is still there and is quite deep."]],[1614,["That's the last chance, I would say now, that has to work."]],[1618,["The way the negative forces have set in motion"]],[1622,["of which you may not be aware at all, you may not be aware,"]],[1625,["you don't know what darkness is there."]],[1631,["And to fight it, what one has to do"]],[1636,["is to bring that light of the Spirit,","which integrates."]],[1642,["Darkness always disintegrates you."]],[1645,["For example, there's complete darkness, all right,"]],[1647,["I can't feel you, I don't know who you are, where you are sitting."]],[1651,["We are all separate."]],[1652,["I can't see you, I don't know who you people are there."]],[1656,["I wouldn't know where is the window, where is the door."]],[1659,["I'll hold this and say, \"This is the truth\"."]],[1663,["All disintegrated personalities,","and disintegrated people,"]],[1668,["always see aberrations. They see different things,"]],[1670,["different auras, different things."]],[1675,["Now, it's a very vicious circle.","You just think of it."]],[1680,["It's a very great vicious circle we have."]],[1685,["The vicious circle is that we try to think about it,"]],[1694,["which is limited."]],[1696,["Supposing I have a limited vision, there's darkness"]],[1700,["what will I feel?"]],[1704,["You start thinking about it and thinking about it,","pondering over it."]],[1708,["The more you think about it, the worse it becomes."]],[1717,["Another way could be people may try to solve this problem,"]],[1721,["to think that we are disintegrated,"]],[1724,["is to talk of big things, \"We are all brothers and sisters,"]],[1728,["let's form U.N. counseling,"]],[1731,["let's do world organization\"."]],[1735,["All blind people doing world organization will end up"]],[1739,["at the most, as a labour, what you call, labour department."]],[1747,["That's all."]],[1749,["With all these institutions","working in the big name,"]],[1757,["where are we?"]],[1760,["Actually, when we become aware, we don't need them."]],[1767,["We don't need at all."]],[1771,["So, this awareness is nothing but"]],[1774,["the light of the Spirit within you which is missing."]],[1779,["The Spirit is watching you, all right."]],[1781,["It goes up to a point"]],[1783,["to see your stupidity and your limitedness."]],[1789,["And it goes up to a very great extent, I should say,","where it's finished."]],[1795,["It disappears and a person dies,"]],[1798,["or he gets into trouble, he becomes creazy, mad,"]],[1801,["whatever you may call him."]],[1803,["He develops other diseases like cancer,"]],[1809,["which are caused by another problem here,","as you know, Ekadesha."]],[1816,["So, these forces are built within us, of negativity,"]],[1824,["when we go to the extremes of negativity."]],[1829,["So, in the Kundalini shastra,"]],[1832,["we can say that the left and right side","when used too much,"]],[1839,["you build up these forces in the head of eleven Rudras,","the eleven distructive forces."]],[1845,["A cancer patient develops it."]],[1848,["But even before developing cancer,","people can develop it."]],[1852,["And there are so many things,","that can create this,"]],[1859,["that sometimes one would feel,","in this vicious circle"]],[1863,["that, \"How are you going to patch up the whole society?\""]],[1868,["And there's only one thing,","that will save the situation, it's Self-realization."]],[1878,["All other things are destroying, are absolutely confusing."]],[1888,["But there's only one thing if you can do,"]],[1891,["it saves the whole thing, like putting on the light, finished!"]],[1898,["But people don't understand the importance of Self-realization,"]],[1903,["because some people ask me, \"What's the use of getting the cool breeze in the hand?\""]],[1908,["Now, see the big canvas of the whole thing, the whole cosmos,"]],[1912,["in a jeopardy."]],[1914,["See what's happening to human beings today."]],[1918,["And if they are to be saved, no use being unhappy."]],[1923,["Like in France they said, \"You cannot, Mother, say you are very happy person\"."]],[1928,["I said, \"Why?\""]],[1930,["\"Because that means you are ignorant of the shocks.\""]],[1937,["You see, I have to say  \"I am very unhappy\", you see."]],[1940,["I have to paint some lines here to show you,"]],[1942,["that I'm very deeply concerned,"]],[1945,["worried about the whole world."]],[1949,["But what is the solution have you got?"]],[1952,["You want me to be like you only?"]],[1955,["Is that the solution?"]],[1957,["That if ten people are weeping you also join them weeping?"]],[1960,["Is that the solution?"]],[1965,["And the one and only method that we have"]],[1972,["which has been already told and prescribed"]],[1976,["and has been prophesized,"]],[1980,["nobody seeks it.","No one seeks it."]],[1984,["See now, in the Bible: you have to be born again,"]],[1987,["Christ is to be born in your heart."]],[1989,["I mean, they do it, even before solving the whole drama"]],[1992,["they do it by giving you the second birth,"]],[1994,["by Christening you, so called."]],[1998,["Hindus they believe without yoga is there's no sense."]],[2001,["\"Yoga kshema vahamyam\" Krishna said all the time that,"]],[2004,["\"You seek yoga\". What are you seeking?"]],[2005,["All these treatises and all these big books"]],[2008,["and all the scriptures are aiming at what?"]],[2011,["Even, those who talked, \"You must live with dharma","you must live a balanced life\""]],[2015,["For what? Why do you do it?"]],[2018,["What is the destination?"]],[2020,["And the destination is the Spirit."]],[2024,["And today the background is so black,","is so dark,"]],[2031,["that this solution is","the end of everything."]],[2038,["But do we realize this?"]],[2042,["On the contrary, the vicious circle builts in, within us,","all the time."]],[2047,["\"Oh, see how the world is miserable."]],[2051,["Then how can I be happy?"]],[2056,["I'm so unhappy in life.\""]],[2058,["I have yet to come across a person before Realization"]],[2061,["saying that, \"I am a happy person\"."]],[2065,["Maybe ego-oriented people might say, \"I'm happy\",","meaning \"my ego is\"."]],[2069,["You see, if he goes in a swanky car, or something like that,"]],[2072,["he's very happy, on top of the world."]],[2075,["After ten minutes, you see him [looking sad]"]],[2080,["and this vicious circle is set in."]],[2083,["This ego-oriented circle, or another one, it sets in."]],[2087,["Another vicious circle and another vicious circle"]],[2090,["and another vicious circle,"]],[2092,["we go on from one to another,"]],[2094,["moving on the wheels after wheels,"]],[2099,["without realizing that, \"Where we are going?\""]],[2108,["And this vicious circle has to be broken by one faith,"]],[2115,["by one understanding, that God is forgiveness."]],[2121,["God is Love."]],[2126,["When we feel love for anyone, without any lust and greed,"]],[2131,["then that is God’s love within us."]],[2136,["That he is the embodiment of that pure love,"]],[2143,["which just loves,"]],[2147,["which has given you this beautiful human life"]],[2150,["and wants to make you more beautiful."]],[2155,["He created all this creation for you"]],[2158,["and that he wants you to enjoy the bounties of this creation."]],[2163,["He wants you to enjoy the citizen of his realm"]],[2166,["and the Kingdom of his Grace."]],[2173,["Do we go to see someone"]],[2176,["who is highly placed, with a morose face? Do we?"]],[2180,["That day, we'll specially brush up the hair,"]],[2183,["see, make our hair into a beautiful thing,"]],[2185,["make our face nice, dress up well,"]],[2188,["It looks like we are well, you see."]],[2191,["That’s outside."]],[2195,["Inside, if you just feel how kind he is,"]],[2202,["how he has worked out meticulously"]],[2207,["in this blissful life of a human being."]],[2210,["But think how much he has done for you!"]],[2214,["Instead of that, if you are all the time going to say,"]],[2216,["“I am very unhappy in life.”"]],[2219,["I mean, think of someone who does everything for you"]],[2221,["and you can just come back saying,"]],[2223,["“Oh, I am a very unhappy person.”"]],[2225,["What is he going to feel about it?"]],[2227,["No gratitude."]],[2229,["Count your blessings one by one."]],[2233,["That’s what one has to do,"]],[2235,["is to have complete understanding"]],[2239,["that he is God Almighty."]],[2242,["He can do anything that he likes."]],[2246,["and we are the recipient of His Allmighty."]],[2252,["He is the Ocean of love,"]],[2255,["and we are the recipient of his love."]],[2262,["Let us feel that, within ourselves, and understand logically with wisdom."]],[2269,["If this sets into your mind,"]],[2272,["that’s the best conditioning I think human beings can have,"]],[2277,["what you call in Sanskrit as  \"Susamskara\","]],[2279,["means the auspicious conditionings."]],[2282,["You see, we don't have only conditioning and ego."]],[2286,["We have third thing called also good conditioning."]],[2291,["The conditionings that are ruining your chances of enjoyment,"]],[2296,["let it be brought round."]],[2300,["And see for yourself, logically you can see"]],[2303,["how much is done for you."]],[2310,["I mean none of the animals were that comfortable as you are."]],[2314,["They don't know the idea of comfort. I mean they have never had a car,"]],[2316,["even chairs to sit down."]],[2323,["It's easy to say, \"Nice to be like animals\" you see."]],[2326,["But just go and see the way they live poor things!"]],[2329,["No. Even the king of the forest, how he lives, one should go and see."]],[2334,["But he's happy. He's full of joy."]],[2339,["Now he has to kill an animal, he'll kill it,"]],[2341,["and with his dignity eat one or two days, finished."]],[2345,["Then he lives for ten days without food."]],[2347,["Whenever he feels hungry he goes, he's not bothered."]],[2351,["He doesn't feel guilty for killing anybody,"]],[2353,["he is hungry, he has to eat, he eats, finished."]],[2358,["But human beings, as they are,"]],[2361,["they will eat someone without the need, and they'll feel guilty."]],[2366,["This is the problem."]],[2373,["He has made you with his own image."]],[2376,["He's done everything beautifully."]],[2380,["After Realization, you start understanding yourself"]],[2383,["and enjoying yourself as you enjoy others."]],[2386,["The fragrance of others you start enjoying."]],[2391,["Self-realization is the only way, you can get the light in."]],[2397,["Enlightenment. Everybody talks of enlightenment, enlightenment."]],[2402,["Enlightenment, means for some people is that you start jumping."]],[2407,["Is it enlightenement to be abnormal like that?","Or take out your clothes?"]],[2410,["I mean, just think of it, how does it go into your brains,"]],[2413,["I can't understand, that doing all these nonsensical things,"]],[2417,["how can there be enlightenment?"]],[2420,["Or taking to alcohol, drinking or"]],[2422,["drugs or anything. How can it give you enlightenment?"]],[2425,["Has it given to anyone so far?"]],[2429,["It might be some sort of a funny strange experience  you might get,"]],[2432,["but not enlightenment."]],[2434,["In enlightenment, you get integrated,"]],[2436,["you see your way through, you know where you are standing"]],[2439,["and how you are moving in relationship to others."]],[2445,["So the illogical method, I would say, unwise method,"]],[2451,["the way we deal with life, becomes a kind of a possession."]],[2466,["And we are possessed by this negative force which is eating us up."]],[2471,["And we go on living with that idea, enjoing that idea,"]],[2475,["that, we are miserable people, we are unhappy, we are helpless."]],[2480,["I mean, I've seen people sitting on the streets and discussing,"]],[2483,["\"Oh, thank God, there's going to be 8 stars coming in and we'll be all destroyed\"."]],[2487,["I mean just imagine!"]],[2492,["But we have to think about the One who has created us."]],[2495,["Is he waiting for your destruction, will he be happy with that?"]],[2502,["How much are you cooperating with Him?"]],[2506,["With what care, love, he has created us?"]],[2511,["With what hopes whatever it is,"]],[2513,["what does he want to do for us"]],[2514,["that you are sitting down and feeling guilty?"]],[2517,["And now, I have to tell openly,"]],[2519,["that it has come to you also through other vechicles,"]],[2524,["apart from the psychologists, psychoanalysts."]],[2529,["Psychoanalysts: the other day we had a girl,"]],[2532,["she came to see Me."]],[2533,["She's French. Her English was wonderful,"]],[2536,["and she said,"]],[2538,["\"Horrible psychologists! They make me mad.\""]],[2541,["\"Why?\" They said, \"I have bad relationship with my mother,"]],[2544,["I have bad relationship with my father,"]],[2546,["bad relationship with every third person\"."]],[2548,["I don't have that, I've absolutely pure relationship."]],[2551,["They try to put that idea into my head"]],[2553,["that there's something abnormal, pathological about me"]],[2555,["which I am not!"]],[2557,["And they are making my brother's relationship also funny"]],[2561,["by telling him that I have bad relations with him."]],[2565,["This is it."]],[2567,["So they hit at the point of pure love,"]],[2569,["desintegrate you."]],[2571,["You can't have good relationship with your own mother,"]],[2574,["with your own father, with your own sister, with your brother, and nobody."]],[2578,["Because you cannot love except for, you are sex points."]],[2581,["You have just relationship of sex."]],[2583,["Even animals have better relationship then we have,"]],[2585,["if you have to accept the psychologists."]],[2589,["And they take money to suggest","all these nonsensical ideas into your head."]],[2593,["There are some here sitting. I will face them later on."]],[2599,["This is how they're putting ideas into your heads"]],[2602,["that, \"You are a person who has no, no purity"]],[2607,["and that you are a sinner,"]],[2609,["you are a damned person and any person you look upon,"]],[2612,["you have only sex relationships, nothing else."]],[2615,["I mean are we sex points?"]],[2619,["With all this evolution God has made us into a sex point:"]],[2623,["that's what we have done to ourselves, reduced ourselves to that point only."]],[2630,["He has created you in your own glory and in your own dignity."]],[2637,["He's not created you"]],[2638,["to be only wasted like this"]],[2642,["Then the second thing that disintegrates us very much more,"]],[2646,["is the idea that we are here, you see,","to live in a gross way,"]],[2655,["somehow fighting, political, economic,"]],[2660,["all these nonsensical progress that we are making."]],[2666,["And everything is explained,","all destructive forces are explained"]],[2671,["in the name of political or economic growth."]],[2675,["I don't know if it is 'growth' or whatever it is,"]],[2679,["but definetely it is not love, take it from me."]],[2682,["It is not love."]],[2686,["That's why economics of God is to be understood."]],[2691,["Politics of God is to be understood."]],[2694,["And for human beings to understand it, they must have Self-realization."]],[2699,["In his economics, generosity is the key-note."]],[2706,["He enjoys his generosity."]],[2711,["Material things are to express your generosity, isn't it?"]],[2718,["What are they for?"]],[2720,["The most enjoyable thing is to give,"]],[2724,["and when you give, you will see","your economic problems will be solved completely."]],[2732,["Because you are here to become free,  no problems!"]],[2735,["The problems are because you want to grab."]],[2741,["And once you start giving, you get it,","as much as you want,"]],[2745,["because if there's no outlet, there's no joy,"]],[2750,["there's no happiness, there's no release."]],[2753,["from the material domination on you."]],[2756,["But giving is the way"]],[2759,["you can get rid of that material domination on your head."]],[2763,["That you give away."]],[2767,["Give away everything that you have"]],[2768,["and you'll be surprised how it flows to you."]],[2774,["Now, when I say, \"It is fantastic the way it acts."]],[2777,["Fantastic, the way it acts\"."]],[2779,["Somehow, it’s easy to say,"]],[2782,["“It’s Mother is saying something"]],[2784,["which is something miraculous.”"]],[2789,["But what do you think of Moses","crossing the river, crossing the sea?"]],[2794,["You mean, it was miraculous,"]],[2796,["or it was a false stoy or what do you think of it?"]],[2802,["It was absolutely true,"]],[2805,["that he did cross the sea. With the help of God, he could do it."]],[2812,["What about Christ walking on the water?"]],[2814,["He did because by his nature, he did it."]],[2818,["What about all the miracles that were done by this Incarnation?"]],[2821,["It's absolutely true, I'm here to prove all of them."]],[2828,["But you must get your Realization."]],[2830,["Not because that I cannot prove it,"]],[2832,["You must enter into that realm of awareness.","Otherwise, they cannot prove it."]],[2836,["It's true. The other day,","somebody was saying that Rama is a fiction."]],[2839,["I said, \"How do you say?\""]],[2841,["He said, \"Because, it looks like a fiction\"."]],[2843,["I said, \"To human mind, they cannot understand God,"]],[2847,["who has millions and millions of hands and eyes"]],[2851,["to work out His plans\"."]],[2853,["So, naturally Rama is a fiction.","Krishna is a fiction. Everybody is a fiction!"]],[2858,["Because we ourselves are fictitious, I think."]],[2863,["It's not that it is a fiction"]],[2865,["but we are incapable of grasping that is miraculous, which is divine."]],[2869,["and that's why we just call it, \"Oh\"."]],[2873,["No, everything is true, believe me, everything is true."]],[2877,["Now, Rama' s case, let's take it."]],[2880,["Simple to be like Rama, all right?"]],[2882,["\"Rama is a fiction\"."]],[2884,["Many of our Indians are very anglicised now, very westernized you see."]],[2888,["So, they want to say, \"We don't believe in all these fictions\","]],[2891,["so they're becoming English."]],[2895,["For them, to become English is the last epitome,","it's the last word."]],[2900,["\"So we don't believe in Rama, nothing, you see.\" All right,"]],[2902,["it's all our old style of thinking."]],[2905,["But he exists and he's within us!"]],[2908,["It can be proved with your Kundalini awakening."]],[2912,["The person who has got asthma, who suffers from asthma,"]],[2917,["catches on the right heart."]],[2920,["You have to take the name of Rama to cure him."]],[2924,["Nothing else can cure him. It's simple."]],[2929,["The Kundalini stops here."]],[2932,["Many people don't believe in Christ."]],[2935,["\"We don't believe in Christ\". But you don't believe in Christ, but under what circumstaces?"]],[2941,["Why, why don't you believe in Christ?"]],[2946,["\"Because you see, we don't think he existed, how can it be possible?\""]],[2949,["\"We don't believe in Moses, we don't believe in Christ, we don't believe in anybody\". All right."]],[2954,["Do you believe in yourself?"]],[2957,["Perhaps that is missing."]],[2960,["Because the Self is not there."]],[2964,["If you know your Self, you should believe in them."]],[2967,["Because when Kundalini rises, at this point you'll be amazed,"]],[2971,["at this point, whether you believe in Christ or not,"]],[2974,["at this point,"]],[2976,["at the Agnya chakra, where you see the crossing of it,"]],[2980,["you have to say Lord's Prayer."]],[2983,["You have to take the name of Christ.","Otherwise, Kundalini doesn't rise."]],[2986,["Now most of the people who are here, who are Realized, know this."]],[2989,["It has been proved to them."]],[2992,["In the Nabhi, in this Void,","if it is hanging, you have to take the name of Moses."]],[2997,["Whether you are a Jew or not, or a hater of Jews","or whatever you may be,"]],[3001,["you have to take the name of a Jew, of Moses."]],[3007,["The whole movement of the Kundalini is to intergrate"]],[3012,["all the truths which are treated as miraculous,","some people think it's falsehood,"]],[3017,["it's good for nothing, useless."]],[3020,["All these things are proved by the movement of the Kundalini"]],[3025,["in your central path."]],[3029,["And the greatest of greatest thing","that is proved, is that God exists."]],[3035,["Not only exists but he's active,"]],[3038,["that he does everything for us,"]],[3042,["that it is he who is the truth and it 's his power of Brahma,"]],[3046,["is the truth, the rest is all falsehood and nonsense."]],[3050,["It works in all details too, in small details also."]],[3055,["Now Sahaja Yogis have seen the miracle of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3058,["they cannot explain it."]],[3060,["You cannot explain also."]],[3062,["When you become Realised, you are surprised"]],[3064,["how you are helped, how you meet people,"]],[3067,["how you get to things, how things work out,"]],[3069,["and how it works out so smoothly, you just can't imagine!"]],[3073,["Even to the smallest detail it can work out beautifully."]],[3079,["But you have to establish yourself in the kingdom of God."]],[3083,["Not with these fanatical ideas,"]],[3086,["like you go to the Catholic church and they say,"]],[3088,["\"Now you must confess\".","I don't know from where did they get this idea!"]],[3092,["I don't think Christ would have ever said that,","\"You'd better go and confess to these priests\","]],[3095,["who are not even Realized souls."]],[3098,["What are they going to do by confession?"]],[3103,["And then the answer came to me from a priest."]],[3106,["I've asked him, he's a nice man, he's a Realized soul now,"]],[3108,["and he is working for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3111,["But he told me, \"The reason is in the Bible it's written,"]],[3114,["that, 'Whatever is corrected on this earth,"]],[3116,["will be corrected in the heaven'."]],[3118,["That's why you'd better correct it by telling to the priest.\""]],[3120,["Now, by any logical means do you think these priests"]],[3123,["can help you by telling them anything?"]],[3128,["Whatever is to be correced","on this earth is your Kundalini and your chakras."]],[3134,["If the language of the Bible has been,"]],[3138,["especially the Old Testament,"]],[3140,["has been extremely guarded, it was security measure."]],[3145,["Like the Tree of Life","is nothing but the Kundalini which is enlightened."]],[3149,["Absolutely, it is that, it looks like that, like a tree."]],[3153,["The other day, we were having program - I think today only,"]],[3156,["my children showed me, \"Look, the Kundalini\"."]],[3158,["I went and saw they were describing about Moses something,"]],[3162,["perhaps, and this was the Tree of Life, they said."]],[3165,["And my children, grandchildren said, \"See, the Kundalini\"."]],[3170,["The language they used, may be for security measures made,"]],[3177,["but not the word,"]],[3181,["if it is now changed by human beings, it's false."]],[3185,["Human beings can change words, that's a different point,"]],[3188,["but you can see, in Sahaja Yoga you can see what is changed,"]],[3192,["what is wrong, which is falsehood. You can see all these things."]],[3195,["So, to disintegrate you,"]],[3197,["these things are again created in the name of religion, so-called."]],[3202,["I mean these people are there for God"]],[3204,["or for making you feel guilty?"]],[3207,["Like, say Jews think that Christ was not a saviour."]],[3213,["If they are still waiting for two hundred years. It's not true."]],[3218,["He's the One, without Him you cannot raise the Kundalini."]],[3221,["One should understand that he's the Mahavishnu described."]],[3225,["But if I say something,"]],[3226,["that doesn't mean that you should believe Me. Not at all."]],[3229,["But you should see for yourself because if you are interested,"]],[3232,["in the emancipation of the whole world,"]],[3234,["you should not get stuck on one,"]],[3239,["stuck on to one thing,"]],[3240,["and say, \"This is the truth and this is the truth\"."]],[3243,["No, seek for yourself what is the truth."]],[3245,["And you'll be amazed that they are all one."]],[3247,["Like Christ has said, \"Those who are not against me"]],[3249,["are people who are with me\"."]],[3253,["Moses and Christ are one, which can be proved."]],[3258,["Same in other religions."]],[3260,["So religion is another way to disintegrate you."]],[3262,["You hate each other. Fundamentalists, fighting for what?"]],[3267,["Fundamental difference you know."]],[3269,["Can you imagine?"]],[3271,["What is the fundamental of these religions? It’s their Spirit, isn’t it?"]],[3274,["Is it a difference between the Spirit of one and another?"]],[3278,["Fundamentals are that God is one.  He's created us"]],[3284,["and what are you fighting about?"]],[3285,["Fundamental difference, you know? Fundamental difference,"]],[3287,["when there exists no difference at all."]],[3290,["So we have psychologists,"]],[3292,["we have religious leaders, teaching us how to fight and hate God"]],[3298,["and your fellow being, in the name of God."]],[3303,["This is another disintegration that sets into us."]],[3307,["So, you people who are thinking, should understand"]],[3312,["that anything that creates such limitation within us"]],[3315,["any kind of fanaticism,"]],[3317,["is dangerous not only to you but to the whole society,"]],[3321,["and if you support it, even this much,"]],[3322,["you are supporting their destruction."]],[3329,["With Sahaja Yoga we can establish,"]],[3331,["that anybody who is a fanatic,"]],[3333,["has problems and sufferes from many diseases"]],[3337,["which normal people don't."]],[3340,["Then there are another type of people who"]],[3343,["say that, \"All right, we don't believe in God."]],[3346,["Because how can God create this fanaticism?\""]],[3349,["How can you blame God for fanaticism?"]],[3351,["I just can't understand. He never created it."]],[3353,["Actually, he never created any difference between you people,"]],[3357,["just a variety, just to make it beautiful, that's all."]],[3360,["See, he didn't create England separately, this separately,"]],[3363,["to that extent the way you think. But he created them"]],[3367,["because they are different organs in the body of God."]],[3371,["Do we take out an eye, and say \"This is an eye"]],[3373,["so I do not have anything to do with it\". Can we?"]],[3378,["It's like that!"]],[3380,["It's simple like that, it's so simple."]],[3383,["The truth is so simple and so starkly lit before you:"]],[3387,["that we are doing all these things, fighting, quarelling,"]],[3394,["all the time within ourselves and without."]],[3399,["Now, for that Self-realization,"]],[3402,["God has placed this wonderful thing, Kundalini within us,"]],[3405,["very beautifully, in the best possible position."]],[3409,["It could not be better anywhere."]],[3412,["To create this happening within us, in our awareness,"]],[3415,["the Kundalini has to rise and give us Realization."]],[3419,["Now, people ask questions to God also, can be."]],[3422,["They can say, \"Why did he do it?","Why didn't he make us wise, to begin with?\""]],[3426,["There are many like that."]],[3427,["He should have just make us wise."]],[3429,["Just from monkeys, dipped into some wisdom powder"]],[3433,["and pushed us out as wise people"]],[3436,["living in the kingdom of God."]],[3439,["\"Why didn't he do it in our evolution,","why did he make us so stupid?\""]],[3445,["One can say to God, you see,","\"Why did You create these problems?\", talking to God."]],[3448,["But who are we to ask Him questions? You see, he does what he likes."]],[3451,["But, there's a reason."]],[3457,["If you have to enter into that complete freedom,","you must know how to be free."]],[3462,["If you are just abandoned people, you have no sense of freedom,"]],[3465,["you don't know how to be choosy about the good and the bad,"]],[3470,["and you do not understand the value of your own wisdom."]],[3476,["And if you are put in charge, imagine,"]],[3478,["some mad people put in charge in government, what will happen to you?"]],[3482,["So you have to grow up to that point to feel your freedom"]],[3486,["that in your freedom, you are righteous."]],[3489,["In that freedom, you are kind."]],[3493,["In that freedom, you are absolutely balanced."]],[3502,["And when that happens to you,"]],[3506,["then only the higher freedom is given to you."]],[3509,["Because that's completely free."]],[3511,["And once that high freedom comes into you,"]],[3515,["then you can feel the responsibility,"]],[3523,["the responsibility to be responsible for your freedom."]],[3533,["To put this beautiful responsability onto you"]],[3536,["you have to know how to use your freedom."]],[3538,["This is only transition which has led all of us,"]],[3541,["into this feeling 'guilty business',"]],[3543,["or this agression. Can you imagine?"]],[3546,["You could have waited for a while"]],[3550,["without feeling so sick."]],[3554,["I mean, sometimes I feel the people are going for a funeral,"]],[3560,["the way they look miserable."]],[3563,["The rest are busy creating such people."]],[3567,["So there are only two types of people, if one sees:"]],[3571,["some who are being victims and another who are victimizing."]],[3577,["So, to have the balance, in the center, to stand in the center,"]],[3581,["God has created this little tide"]],[3586,["where you have to just learn how to weigh your freedom."]],[3589,["He gave you freedom to know,."]],[3591,["And this freedom is the only thing that has created,"]],[3593,["all the problems you face, not God."]],[3597,["God hasn't created any problems for you. No. He wanted to make a very smooth ascent."]],[3602,["He's made your machines so beautifully."]],[3605,["Despite all this, you do get your Realization, no doubt."]],[3610,["But because of habits, you may run down again to it;"]],[3613,["again you may have an ascent, again go down."]],[3616,["It happens with some people, doesn't matter."]],[3618,["But if you are steady, it is going to work out."]],[3622,["It has to work out."]],[3625,["If God has to save his creation, he has to do it."]],[3629,["Only thing: how many are going to cooperate","and take advantage of his compassion is to be seen."]],[3636,["That is the most important thing,","how many are going to be wise to see to their own advantage,"]],[3645,["to their own ascent."]],[3648,["It's the only choice."]],[3651,["May God bless you."]],[3656,["If you have any questions you may ask me,"]],[3659,["and then I will do the Realization."]],[3667,["Mother, how the negative force is created?"]],[3671,["What's it?"]],[3672,["How this negative force is created to begin within?"]],[3675,["What is he saying?"]],[3677,["How the negative force is created, to begin with?"]],[3682,["By the great human beings."]],[3688,["Who has created atom bomb? Same type."]],[3693,["From the very beginning,","they started creating this negative force."]],[3697,["All kinds."]],[3701,["In seeking, as I told you, in seeking,","they set in this vicious circle"]],[3709,["which started creating.","And the, you see, this mistake is small."]],[3713,["What is the mistake in separating a hydrogen atom, isn't it?"]],[3719,["Just they did it, you see, for fun sake maybe."]],[3721,["I don't know why they did it."]],[3724,["But now, that will become like a devil","sitting on everybody's head, in everybody."]],[3727,["Thank God only, whatever they create frightens them, thank God."]],[3731,["So they are not going to use it, but"]],[3734,["who has created that? Human beings."]],[3738,["In ignorance, they have done it."]],[3740,["As a Mother, I have to say that."]],[3743,["I cannot say that it was deliberated."]],[3745,["It's a dangerous situation there."]],[3754,["It's obvious, in your lifetime, people have created atom bombs."]],[3757,["What was the need?"]],[3761,["I mean, for a stranger like me,"]],[3763,["I don't understand what is the need to create an atom bomb,"]],[3765,["what is the need?"]],[3770,["Who are they to create this kind of a democracy"]],[3773,["and this kind of communism,"]],[3776,["and this kind of all nonsensical institutions,"]],[3779,["which just make the people fight?"]],[3790,["Any other questions please?"]],[3792,["And you can't blame God for that."]],[3795,["At least, God didn't tell you to make atom bomb."]],[3806,["Any other question please?"]],[3809,["I have got one."]],[3810,["Yes."]],[3811,["Why do you think, are people"]],[3813,["all the time so afraid of losing things,"]],[3816,["of losing their ego, of losing their relatives, or-"]],[3822,["but not losing but -"]],[3825,["losing their - what they have built up in themselves,"]],[3829,["their identity that they think they are."]],[3831,["They are afraid of losing it."]],[3834,["Why they are afraid?"]],[3836,["Yes."]],[3836,["They have been cooked up like that, you know."]],[3839,["They are told like that, they are conditioned like that."]],[3842,["What can they do?"]],[3844,["You see, that all the time, if somebody tells you"]],[3846,["that you are going to lose, \"It's very precious, very precious\","]],[3848,["you see, you'll hold on to it."]],[3851,["But one must know in growth, in life,"]],[3854,["when a flower becomes a fruit,"]],[3856,["it looses flower for fruit to come,"]],[3859,["to grow into new."]],[3862,["When an egg breaks,","its shell falls off and the bird comes out."]],[3869,["It's not a loosing, it is growth."]],[3874,["You have been frightened, what can you do?","From the very beginning."]],[3881,["What is there to lose","if you are not holding on to anything?"]],[3886,["All right?"]],[3888,["What is there to lose, you just tell me?"]],[3890,["If you're not holding onto something,"]],[3892,["then, if there's no catch on anything,"]],[3895,["what are you going to loose? You are just enjoing on giving."]],[3902,["What do we take from here?"]],[3905,["When we go our hands are like this,"]],[3908,["when we come our hands are like this."]],[3911,["Our hands are open, when we go."]],[3914,["We can't take anything, we confess it."]],[3917,["Even ego we leave here. Everything we leave here."]],[3924,["All myths, so many myths have been created,"]],[3927,["and man is living with the mythical ideas."]],[3929,["I tell you he's living, he's compromizing with the myths."]],[3932,["All the time, he doesn't accept a myth"]],[3935,["then they say, \"He's not a sane person\"."]],[3937,["All sorts of, and then many, many myths set in."]],[3939,["People start copying others, you see, blindly."]],[3943,["It's all, you see, to an ignorant person like me,"]],[3948,["it's something I just don't understand; what is the need?"]],[3956,["But I'm talking of the real world where you have to enter into,"]],[3960,["it is reality."]],[3962,["And do you know? Reality is love."]],[3967,["It's love."]],[3969,["But not the way human beings understand love."]],[3974,["But love which flows,"]],[3977,["which thinks, which cooperates,"]],[3981,["and generates the feeling of joy."]],[3986,["It's a very different world that we have to enter into."]],[3990,["But what will you lose? What have you got?"]],[3995,["What you have that is lost?"]],[3999,["That's your Spirit."]],[4000,["And what you don't have, you are holding on to it."]],[4005,["There's nothing to be lost, it's very true,"]],[4007,["they are so fightened, you don't know."]],[4011,["Very frightened."]],[4018,["They are made like that, what can you do?"]],[4024,["But they lose everything to a person"]],[4026,["who knows how to handle this condition in the real sense."]],[4030,["You can just become like a cabage with some people."]],[4033,["Really, they can make you a cabbage."]],[4038,["In the name of God, in the name of enlightenement, they can."]],[4041,["Yes, they can harm you."]],[4048,["Then they are not worried."]],[4050,["I don't know how they get this confidence with that."]],[4052,["Like the other day,","we had somebody from 'Charismatic Movement'."]],[4055,["You remember that? Norman."]],[4057,["And I hope you have not taken any"]],[4060,["photographe of him, did you?"]],[4062,["We were also worried about him."]],[4064,["And he went into such movements of the body,"]],[4068,["for at least half an hour"]],[4071,["he was so much in a very funny type of epilepsy, you see."]],[4075,["All his body was moving and terrible he was crying, weeping"]],[4079,["he fell down on the ground, you can't imagine."]],[4083,["And he said, \"This I've been doing and so many are doing like this,"]],[4086,["and they think they are getting into Holy Ghost\"."]],[4088,["I said, \"Holy Ghost?"]],[4090,["What an unholy thing it is to be like that\"."]],[4094,["Holy Ghost? Can you imagine?"]],[4106,["He wanted to get out of it. He could not."]],[4109,["Now, he's all right, perfectly all right."]],[4110,["He's like a small little child."]],[4112,["I wish you could see that, John."]],[4116,["You should have seen it, really."]],[4120,["Shocking it was. Much worse than TM, I tell you, much worse."]],[4126,["Because the movement was so fast,"]],[4131,["unrhythmic, big fast movements."]],[4134,["The whole body was gesticulating and this was too much."]],[4143,["But he got cured."]],[4153,["Any other question?"]],[4163,["Ego is one problem, I must say, it's a very big problem."]],[4168,["And for ego,"]],[4171,["like some people say,  \"Mother, why You should do it?\""]],[4175,["I said, \"You better do it, it's very good idea."]],[4178,["I would like to retire\"."]],[4181,["But you can't do it, what to do? You see."]],[4183,["All right, now you do so many things, I don´t feel bad."]],[4187,["Why should you feel bad if I know something."]],[4189,["You know one thing I know is to awaken, awakening of the Kundalini."]],[4192,["Now, what can I do about it?"]],[4195,["Are you going to crucify me for that?"]],[4201,["I mean I don't get any - what you call -"]],[4205,["title from your government for that,"]],[4208,["no payment, nothing."]],[4213,["So why? Why to feel bad?"]],[4214,["I mean I will make you the same way."]],[4216,["You will raise other's Kundalini also."]],[4219,["So what's the harm?"]],[4221,["You will, of course, you are going to do it yourself."]],[4225,["Supposing I have the keys with me: if I give you the keys"]],[4228,["will you feel your ego will be hurt or not?"]],[4230,["See, if I am a trustee, I have to give you isn't it?"]],[4234,["Do you feel your ego hurt, if I give you your keys?"]],[4237,["It's so simple as that."]],[4244,["This is your own, this is your own property, I've got the keys,"]],[4247,["I'll give you because I have got them, now what to do?"]],[4251,["If you have them, it's very good,"]],[4254,["You never had, so I'm giving you."]],[4258,["What is there to feel hurt about that part?"]],[4262,["Actually, I have to work very hard."]],[4264,["You don't have to work hard at all."]],[4266,["To begin with, then up to you."]],[4277,["Any other question?"]],[4281,["I would like Sahaja Yogis to ask me questions,"]],[4284,["for one reason, because when they are faced with life, and"]],[4287,["other people will ask them questions,"]],[4289,["so any questions which you have not been able to answer"]],[4292,["you can ask me and then we have our Realization."]],[4299,["Mother?"]],[4300,["Yes?"]],[4301,["What is the approach towards the Christian Church?"]],[4304,["What is it?"]],[4306,["What it's our approach, the line, for the Christian Church?"]],[4310,["Have pity for them."]],[4317,["You see, I took my birth in the Christian religion, in India,"]],[4322,["and first, the Hindus, you see, they were very upset"]],[4325,["that, \"How could She take birth in a Christian religion?\""]],[4330,["I mean, so-called Christian religion."]],[4333,["And I must tell you, I was baptized forcibly by a Lutheran Church."]],[4341,["All right?"]],[4345,["The simple answer is that Christians are the most fanatic people."]],[4352,["And the Indian Christians are the worst"]],[4356,["because they think Christ was born in England."]],[4360,["Really they think so. You see, if you have an English name"]],[4363,["then you are a real Christian. Otherwise, you are not."]],[4366,["You can't imagine how ignorant they are."]],[4369,["And how the Christans are most fanatic. It looks funny but it is so."]],[4374,["Because their fanatism is so beautifully managed."]],[4380,["It is not like Khomeini is, which is stark open fanaticism."]],[4384,["You know, Khomeini is that and he has to accept he is."]],[4388,["But this way it is very well polished, you know, beautifully done."]],[4393,["Others can be said they are stones"]],[4396,["but this is like a diamond artificially made."]],[4399,["They do social work this Christian way."]],[4404,["Now for example, if you ask somebody the way in England,"]],[4407,["it's a Christian way to tell the way, you see."]],[4410,["What God has got to do with this?Just tell me."]],[4413,["They have mixed up God with all these things,"]],[4415,["it's such a big mixture they have made,"]],[4418,["that the fanaticism of Christianity is very much in delusion."]],[4425,["For them, begging in the name of God is also Christian."]],[4433,["It's a very dangerous game,"]],[4435,["because they are the cleverest of all, they think."]],[4438,["So, the way they have entangled themselves into,"]],[4442,["it's so much dogmatic and so beautifully philosophised."]],[4447,["It's a philosophy."]],[4449,["To know it, you have to get out of it."]],[4452,["It is so beautiful, you can't imagine. It's so beautiful."]],[4458,["And so appealing, they are the most kindest people,"]],[4463,["compassion personified, great people, Christians."]],[4468,["And the Christains believe it. Christ never asked you to beg."]],[4473,["He never asked you to collect money for the poor."]],[4476,["Nothing of the kind. It was not his idea at all, you see."]],[4481,["He wanted you to get your Realization."]],[4483,["That's what he wanted."]],[4486,["You have created the poor."]],[4489,["And you'd better look after them. That's not God's job."]],[4493,["Communists may be the greatest Christians, like that,"]],[4496,["the way they look after their poor."]],[4499,["God's job is one: is to give you Realization. Not other one."]],[4506,["To take you away from this ignorance and mire of life,"]],[4513,["into that beautiful, blissful, kingdom of God."]],[4517,["That is the work of God."]],[4521,["And not these things which you describe back."]],[4524,["But it looks so idealistic, you know,","the whole thing is such an idealism."]],[4530,["That's why it's very, very dangerous."]],[4532,["And it's so well organized."]],[4538,["So well organized, you know, so well organized."]],[4542,["Even the hymn numbers, everything is done so well,","every book done so well."]],[4547,["Stand up to sing. Now you sit down.","So regimented, beautifully."]],[4551,["No one can realize even that this is,"]],[4554,["we are going all to madness, you see."]],[4556,["It's a very wonderful thing."]],[4560,["You are not supposed to look this side or that side."]],[4562,["It's all right. In England, I have Christians,"]],[4565,["many have been Christians, you see."]],[4568,["I have Christians, Jews, all kinds of disciples."]],[4570,["Indian Christians, I don't have even one. Except for,","of course, my family people are from there,"]],[4574,["but they've known my childhood, they know me."]],[4577,["But the rest of them, for them I am a healer!"]],[4584,["I am, believe me!"]],[4590,["Hindus are my disciples, then Muslims are. But not Christians."]],[4595,["Not one, I knew this."]],[4601,["And when I went to America,","they pronounced, \"A Christian mystic has come\"."]],[4609,["That gave me good marks, you know."]],[4615,["People came to see me because I was a Christian mystic,"]],[4619,["properly baptized. I must get my certificate also."]],[4628,["So our attitude should be of simply pity towards them."]],[4633,["Like Blake has said, \"The priest cursed,"]],[4637,["cursed my head when he baptized me.\""]],[4640,["It's something like that, it is really."]],[4642,["We should have really simple pity for all the people,"]],[4644,["who go to churches where there are all the graves."]],[4648,["They sit on the graves, take all the spirits into themselves."]],[4652,["God save them."]],[4658,["I don't know why Christians, everyone is just like that."]],[4669,["But, among the Christians only, I am sure,"]],[4672,["one day Sahaja Yoga will come up very well."]],[4678,["That's the power of Christ. I hope so.","I hope so."]],[4690,["Mislaid, and misled people also,"]],[4695,["who are enjoying that misleading"]],[4698,["are most difficult, aren't they?","Don't you think so?"]],[4701,["How can you talk to them?"]],[4704,["Who can break it?"]],[4713,["When I go to India, I can speak,"]],[4716,["in a 'sanathana', means Catholic,","'sankar sanathana' means Catholic temple,"]],[4722,["where thousands of people came to attend my lecture"]],[4725,["and they respect me as a saint."]],[4728,["Do you think in any church whatsoever,"]],[4732,["I would be respected like that,"]],[4734,["except for one \"Unity Church\" we had,"]],[4737,["where all kinds of bhoots are respected."]],[4739,["So, I was also called to give a lecture."]],[4743,["It was I think more of a - I don't know,","money-making proposition whatever it was."]],[4749,["Whatever it was."]],[4753,["But in India, that's the blessing"]],[4757,["of the Hindus that they are not organized."]],[4760,["For them, a saint is a saint."]],[4764,["Even the Prime minister, even, I would say, the president"]],[4772,["of India would stand for a saint. They wouldn't sit."]],[4779,["These ideas are not here."]],[4782,["We're too organized to get out of this organized way,"]],[4787,["to find out what is beyond. You see, we just -"]],[4792,["all our spirituality is satisfied by going to Sunday church,"]],[4795,["finished! Or to give some money for the feat. That's all."]],[4798,["That's not the way it is."]],[4800,["It's much, much, much more."]],[4803,["But be kind to them."]],[4807,["Christ has said, \"You'll be calling me, 'Christ, Christ'.","I won't recognize you\""]],[4811,["That's what they are. I'm sorry for them, really sorry."]],[4822,["Any other question?"]],[4826,["Mother, can everybody become aware at the most"]],[4829,["how do you recognize them up?"]],[4831,["Yes, everybody can."]],[4834,["But everybody doesn't mind, want it."]],[4837,["You see, they don't want it. See how many people are here."]],[4843,["But if it was some sort of a falsehood,"]],[4846,["if I'd come with two horns,"]],[4848,["there could have been three halls big like this."]],[4853,["People don't want reality, my child, they don't want it."]],[4856,["They never wanted it."]],[4859,["They always crucified it."]],[4862,["But now, at least, there are some who really want it."]],[4865,["And I am happy you think of others also,"]],[4868,["very happy to know that."]],[4872,["But it’s a difficult task."]],[4876,["I have to work very hard."]],[4881,["They don't want reality","because in Sahaja Yoga it is a becoming,"]],[4884,["It is not just to come and fill in a form,"]],[4886,["\"All right, you are the member\", or you pay supposing a one-pound, a membership fees."]],[4891,["It's not that! It's your becoming, what you become!"]],[4895,["It's your thing, that must happen. You must get your properties."]],[4899,["This is the problem."]],[4906,["You have to give up a little bit."]],[4909,["It's easy to give up."]],[4913,["It's very easy but I never talk about it before Realization,"]],[4916,["because after Realization, you just give up."]],[4918,["If I tell you, half of you might go away,"]],[4920,["so I'm not going to tell you."]],[4922,["You'd better get your Realization. It will work it out."]],[4925,["It will establish a new priority within yourself, naturally."]],[4928,["Because if you have light you see."]],[4932,["You see snake as snake and rope as rope."]],[4935,["So, I don't have to tell you,","you just see it, you just feel it, it happens to you."]],[4940,["Yes, I know, I know. I wish I could."]],[4942,["It can be done to all the new people,"]],[4946,["whatever race you may belong; it can."]],[4948,["But how many are there?"]],[4952,["It's a very slow movement."]],[4954,["For four years, I had only seven Britons with me."]],[4959,["I was struggling with them. Four years, can you imagine? In England."]],[4968,["It's tremendous task."]],[4971,["All right. So, you get your Realization now."]],[4974,["Let's see how many you bring in."]],[4978,["Yes?"]],[4980,["Divine Holy Mother, after Self-realization,"]],[4985,["how long it takes for a new [unclear]"]],[4989,["is it possible to stop reincarnating and seek perfection?"]],[4993,["Is it easy? Last, what did he say? What d'you say?"]],[5000,["Is it easy to? Last sentence, what do you say?"]],[5004,["I was saying after Realization, is it possible"]],[5007,["to stop reincarnating"]],[5010,["and to be perfect in these troubled times?"]],[5015,["You are reincarnated by Self-realization itself."]],[5021,["And to stop having rebirth and birth?"]],[5024,["You don't think of these things afterwards."]],[5027,["Because you are not futuristic anymore. You live in the present."]],[5034,["You see these ideas of rebirth and"]],[5036,["this frightening stuff: you should not have rebirth."]],[5039,["Why not?"]],[5042,["I mean, you create a beautiful house, everything,"]],[5047,["and then you say that you don't live in it?"]],[5051,["When you become a rich man, you want to enjoy your wealth isn't it?"]],[5056,["But they're not Buddha's saying:"]],[5059,["birth is suffering, death is suffering."]],[5062,["Yes, that's true, but not Realization."]],[5072,["You see, what he has said is:"]],[5075,["Buddha never asked you to"]],[5077,["to limit your desire of ascent."]],[5081,["Because people talk of God, once"]],[5083,["they talked of it in India but nobody talked of the deities."]],[5086,["That was a problem, because it became a talk again."]],[5090,["Then they talked of a God which was abstract,"]],[5095,["like you can say, Jehova and other things,"]],[5099,["because they wanted people to get over their"]],[5103,["stuck-up points you see. Nothing worked you see."]],[5108,["So Buddha said, \"All right, let's talk only about","the Self-realization, nothing else. Not even of God."]],[5113,["Let's talk of that.","Let people get to Self-realization, then we'll talk about God."]],[5119,["So, he said, \"All right. Only Self-realization. No God, nothing.\""]],[5123,["That was his job. Fix you up with the idea of Self-realization."]],[5128,["He said, \"Dont' worship anything, don't worship, get your Self-realization."]],[5132,["They are worshipping everything under the sun, these Buddists!"]],[5138,["What am I to do?"]],[5144,["So whatever Buddha has said,","everything is re-said in Sahaja Yoga."]],[5152,["“Buddham sharanam gachami.”"]],[5155,["I surrender myself to the enlightened One."]],[5159,["The One which is enlightened is your Spirit."]],[5165,["“Sangham sharanam gachami,”"]],[5168,["I surrender myself to the collectivity."]],[5170,["Unless and until you are a collectively conscious person,"]],[5173,["how can you surrender?"]],[5177,["Buddha also, whatever he said,","is not understood before Realization. You cannot."]],[5181,["“Dharmam sharanam gachami,”"]],[5183,["is the sustanance within us."]],[5186,["'Sharanam' means you become that."]],[5188,["It's not a mental thing, \"Oh, I surrender myself\"."]],[5191,["But you just become."]],[5196,["You become the enlightened one."]],[5198,["You become the collectively conscious."]],[5201,["You become the dharma, the sustenance, the religion within us."]],[5205,["You become!"]],[5207,["That's what he meant."]],[5209,["But for them, 'Sharanam gachami' means take a wheel in the hand, go on"]],[5214,["\"Buddham sharanam gachami\"."]],[5216,["Now. What this wheel is going to do, I just don't understand, you know."]],[5221,["They'll go on hours together, they'll go mad."]],[5224,["They will end up into lunatic asylum, beieve me."]],[5228,["Or like mad you have to say something, all the time praying."]],[5232,["Is that the way you are becoming?"]],[5235,["They don't even know where is Buddha placed into yourself."]],[5244,["But Sahaja Yogis know where he is placed"]],[5248,["and how to please him."]],[5250,["Whatever he said is nothing but Sahaja Yoga, absolutely 100%"]],[5260,["Actually, Buddha was nobody else but an Incarnation,"]],[5266,["who reincarnated himself as Adi Shankaracharya."]],[5269,["You can see it clearly in your being,"]],[5271,["it can be proved on Kundalini again!"]],[5273,["You see, how can I prove it?"]],[5279,["To understand them, first you get your Realization."]],[5282,["Again, I am talking like Buddha only."]],[5289,["He tried something","by which he thought people will take to Realization."]],[5294,["But human beings as they are..."]],[5298,["He thought they are very much involved in materialism,"]],[5300,["take them out, try this, try that. Nothing works out."]],[5304,["Nothing."]],[5306,["Only thing that works out: the real happening, nothing else."]],[5316,["Mother, you are [inaudible]?"]],[5319,["What's it?"]],[5322,["Say it loudly."]],[5330,["All right?"]],[5335,["Is there somebody else saying something which I didn't hear?"]],[5339,["Today, the vibrations are so much that really, to be very franck,"]],[5344,["you can't imagine!"]],[5346,["I don't know how I'm listening to you, what you are talking."]],[5348,["It's really too much flowing out."]],[5351,["I can't believe it. Why?"]],[5353,["There must be some great seekers","who must have come today."]]]);
